@ 15.2.5 - Proto-Eskimo to Kuskokwim Yup’ik
# citation: Pogostick Man, from Swadesh, Morris (1952), “Unaaliq and Proto Eskimo IV: Diachronic Notes”, International Journal of American Linguistics, Vol. 18, No. 3 (Jul., 1952), pp. 166–171
